{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"texture paint bleed and occlusion texture paint bleed and occlusion","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion.md","fileName":"Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 01:18\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Texture Painting Workflow]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Texture Painting Workflow","creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"texture paint bleed and occlusion texture paint bleed and occlusion","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion.md","fileName":"Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion","heading":"Texture Paint Bleed and Occlusion","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Texture-paint bleed extends color slightly beyond a face's UV boundary so filtering does not reveal an unpainted seam. The margin should cover expected mipmap and sampling behavior without contaminating nearby islands.\n\nOcclusion, backface, and normal-related options control whether the brush reaches surfaces hidden or turned away from the view. Enabling them appropriately prevents a stroke on the visible side from leaking through to unrelated geometry.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Texture Painting Workflow","creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32